  "description": {
    "en": "HEAD Lynx is a round co-polyester monofilament designed for aggressive club and tournament players who want a lively response, reliable control and strong durability. Its newer co-polymer mixture helps provide a more comfortable and responsive feel than many traditional firm polyester strings. The smooth round profile delivers predictable response and lower friction in hybrid setups, while the three available gauges allow players to prioritize feel, balance or durability.",
    "zh": "HEAD Lynx 是一款采用圆形截面的共聚酯单丝球线，面向积极进攻型的俱乐部和比赛球员，核心特点是活跃的击球反馈、稳定控制以及优秀耐久性。新的共聚物配方让它相比许多传统硬质聚酯拥有更加舒适、灵活的击球感。圆形光滑结构提供更稳定、可预测的反馈，同时在混穿时对其他球线的磨损也更低。1.20毫米更强调手感和响应，1.25毫米综合表现最均衡，1.30毫米则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

